Version: 1

Actor: player "a player"
  Roles: player

Machine: answer-sheet
  Owned by: player
  Started by: "has an answer sheet"
  Context: answer may be empty

  State: Open "is open"

  Trigger: Answer "answers {answer} on {subject}"
    Input: answer is a string
    Sets: answer
    Guarded by: hasAnswer

  # Reads only the trigger's input, so a When's value shows it and it needs no phrases.
  Guard: hasAnswer when input answer is not empty
